   "part_ids": [
    "part:350011"
   ],
   "subject": "Price adjustment from 01 January 2027",
   "text": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nwe have supplied Hollerau Pumpenwerke reliably for many years. Owing to the strong rise in copper and electronic component prices, we are forced to adjust our prices for Motor IE3 7.5 kW, 4-pole (part:350011) by **6.5 %** with effect from **01 January 2027**: from EUR 348.32 to EUR 370.96 per  pc.\n\nWe regret this step and ask for your understanding.\n\nYours faithfully,\nAntriebstechnik Nordmark AG"
  }
